<div class="content">
    <h1>Verification Request Received</h1>

    <p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

    <p>
        We've received your verification request for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>. Thank you for taking
        this important step towards building trust with your audience.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background-color: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <img width="48" height="48"
                    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/clock.png" alt="pending"
                    class="dark-mode-safe"
                    style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: block; margin: 0 auto 12px;" />
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0; font-weight: bold;">
                    Your request is being reviewed
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>
        Our team will carefully review your submission and verify the information you've provided. This process
        typically takes <strong>2-3 business days</strong>.
    </p>

    <!-- What Happens Next -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #004aad; padding-left: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    What happens next?
                </h3>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Our team will review your documents and information</li>
                    <li>You'll receive an email once the review is complete</li>
                    <li>If approved, your organization will receive a verified badge</li>
                    <li>If additional information is needed, we'll reach out to you</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #ecfdf5; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Good to know:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0;">
                    You can continue creating and managing events while we review your verification request.
                    The verification badge will be automatically added to your profile once approved.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    We'll notify you as soon as the review is complete.
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
